  "bodyHash": "v13RC1deUTc=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">永恆地獄為 Minecraft 中最炙熱的維度加溫——將這個火焰地獄轉變為全新的戰場！探索堡壘般的豬布林莊園、高聳的堡壘，以及陰森的地下墓穴，每個地方都充滿了兇猛的新生物和隱藏在灰燼中的強大寶藏。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">拯救盟友、擊敗墮落的敵人，並在一個比以往更生機勃勃、也更加致命的地獄中塑造你的命運。新生物、新戰利品、新方塊——當然，還有超多的岩漿。帶上你最強的裝備、最敏捷的反應，或許再準備幾瓶抗火藥水……你會需要它們的！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏰 新增建築</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">豬布林莊園</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：隱藏在緋紅森林深處，這座宏偉的宅邸是身經百戰的豬布林和兇猛的豬布林獵人的家園。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">堡壘</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：高聳於扭曲森林之上，這座遠古前哨站庇護著危險且墮落的扭曲終界使者。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">☠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">地下墓穴</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一座巨大的凋零怪形狀廢墟，充滿了致命的凋零骷髏變種——以及等待被發掘的秘密。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ 新增生物</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">豬布林獵人</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：手持盾牌和獵殺戰利品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">豬布林囚犯</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：可用黃金和傳說中的獄髓鈴鐺拯救——並會獎勵英雄一面</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">無法破壞的獄髓盾牌</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">扭曲終界使者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一見到你就攻擊——用剪刀逐步淨化它們！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">屍體</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、🗡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋零骷髏騎士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、🌫️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">凋零幽靈</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、以及👻 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋零鬼魂</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">為地獄的黑暗大廳帶來新的挑戰。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ 新增裝備與物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">獄髓鈴鐺</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：需要用它來解放被囚禁的豬布林。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">彎刀</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一把快速的武器，具有經典的劍格擋機制。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">獄髓盾牌</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：無法破壞，且不會被重擊擊退。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💿 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋零華爾滋唱片</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：為你的地獄基地挖掘詭異的新音效。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">扭曲終界珍珠</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：傳送時獲得抗火、緩降等增益效果！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧱 新增建築方塊</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋零黑石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：完整的方塊系列，包括裂紋和裝飾變種。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">☠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋零骨</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、🪵 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋零煤</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、🌋 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋零玄武岩</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、以及🥶 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋零石英</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">方塊系列。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">扭曲地獄磚</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：經典地獄方塊的全新演繹！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌾 農耕強化</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🦴 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋零骨粉</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：大幅強化你的作物——效果比一般骨粉更好！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端及伺服器端皆需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 及 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模組支援配置，可直接在遊戲中透過模組選單進行設定（Fabric 需安裝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">模組選單</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 製作）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，還需要安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge 配置畫面</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若使用外部文字編輯器進行手動配置，所有檔案位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，並根據配置類型命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。並非所有類型都存在於每個模組中，或根本不存在。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/izofar\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Izofar</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 最初創作了驚人的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bygone-nether\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Bygone Nether</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組。本模組是對其工作的忠實延續，並加入了一些新增、改進、重製和錯誤修復。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 創作了許多精美的全新材質。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/metal-bundles\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/leaves-be-gone\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enchanting-infuser\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
